==============================
2 Attacks
==============================
Each attack has it's own state


==============================
2.1 Blade
==============================
enter:
	[direction]

task:
	create collider as child go
		[shape]
		[job when hit]
		[job when parry]

	animation controll
	collider/player position


==============================
2.2 Leg down
==============================
State

task:
	create collider as child go
		[shape]
		[job when hit]
		[job when parry]

	animation controll
	move player down


==============================
2.3 Fire attack
==============================
State

enter:
	[direction]

task:
	q collision with enemhy
		[shape]
	if collided:
		parry process
	else:
		atk process
